<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela M-0 fell 4.08 percent in week to Oct 25.</title>
<headline>Venezuela M-0 fell 4.08 percent in week to Oct 25.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's monetary base fell 4.08 percent, or 45 billion bolivars, to 1.056 trillion bolivars in the week to October 25, the central bank said.</p>
<p>At the beginning of 1996, base money stood at 873 billion bolivars.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
